WEBVTT

00:01.200 --> 00:05.330
Is the whole world going to be
at war from now on?

00:06.070 --> 00:10.370
If that happens, will I be all alone again?

00:10.840 --> 00:12.870
I don't...

00:12.870 --> 00:14.670
I don't want that!

00:15.310 --> 00:17.280
I don't want that!

00:18.510 --> 00:21.140
Don't you worry, Sagiri.

00:22.950 --> 00:25.950
I won't let you end up alone.

00:25.950 --> 00:29.750
These battles, this war...

00:30.530 --> 00:33.320
I'll bring it all to an end!

00:40.200 --> 00:43.410
So, he awakened, did he, Zed?

00:43.410 --> 00:45.370
Amir Gaul...

00:45.370 --> 00:48.000
Why would he have changed color?

01:01.660 --> 01:09.260
Far away from the town where I was born

01:09.260 --> 01:12.430
I am singing

01:12.430 --> 01:20.080
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

01:20.080 --> 01:23.340
Away in my pocket

01:23.340 --> 01:28.880
Toward where I hear someone calling me

01:28.880 --> 01:33.920
Toward the unknown road

01:33.920 --> 01:39.360
I'll walk

01:39.360 --> 01:44.770
I'll move forward

01:44.770 --> 01:49.600
Not for someone else's sake

01:49.600 --> 01:55.080
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

01:55.080 --> 02:00.550
Just as the sun rises at dawn

02:00.550 --> 02:05.790
I pick out a melody with my voice

02:05.790 --> 02:09.810
Ephemerally yet strongly

02:11.460 --> 02:14.990
I live

02:20.400 --> 02:23.860
Episode 37
The Fall of the Capital

03:01.740 --> 03:04.310
I'll go in from the front and draw his attention.

03:04.310 --> 03:06.710
You two use that opening to go
at him from the sides!

03:06.710 --> 03:09.340
I won't take orders from you.

03:10.290 --> 03:13.250
I'll be the one to obliterate
everything in this world.

03:13.250 --> 03:14.880
Pronimo!

03:18.890 --> 03:21.260
Zed, let's do a pincer attack now!

03:21.260 --> 03:22.260
Yeah...

03:22.260 --> 03:23.030
Amir Gaul!

03:23.030 --> 03:24.660
Sachura!
Amir Gaul!

04:09.410 --> 04:10.980
Kira...

04:10.980 --> 04:12.410
Are you okay?

04:12.410 --> 04:14.040
Yeah...

04:14.980 --> 04:18.440
Even the spirits of those three working
together can't stop it?

04:28.100 --> 04:32.700
Your Holiness, the three key spirits,
including Hugh's ,

04:32.700 --> 04:36.540
are fighting together to stop the
rampaging Ulvarx spirit.

04:36.540 --> 04:38.330
Hugh?!

04:40.170 --> 04:46.640
But I never imagined Ulvarx had the technology
to create something like that.

04:47.350 --> 04:49.680
They are too dangerous.

04:49.680 --> 04:52.950
Preventing the creation of such a thing

04:52.950 --> 04:55.420
is another reason we need Absolute Law!

05:34.730 --> 05:36.700
Wh..What is this?

05:50.750 --> 05:53.870
Is he absorbing shard energy from us?!

06:26.350 --> 06:29.150
I..I can't believe him...

06:35.760 --> 06:40.090
To think even three key spirits can't touch him...

06:40.090 --> 06:44.230
Could it be that Great Tusker has resurrected?

06:44.230 --> 06:46.470
Nonsense!

06:46.470 --> 06:48.040
King Gari...

06:48.040 --> 06:50.910
If that were Great Tusker,

06:50.910 --> 06:54.530
those lowly key spirits would have been
vanquished in an instant.

07:14.060 --> 07:15.690
Amir Gaul!

07:18.630 --> 07:20.260
Zed!

07:24.670 --> 07:26.470
What will happen to Zed?!

07:26.470 --> 07:28.280
Let me see Master Zico!

07:28.280 --> 07:30.040
Don't rush so much.

07:30.040 --> 07:32.850
The Council is discussing Zed right now.

07:32.850 --> 07:37.890
And Zico is very busy right now,
with the Council talks dragging on and all.

07:37.890 --> 07:41.120
You say the same things every day,
and they sound like excuses!

07:41.120 --> 07:43.760
Exactly what are you hiding?!

07:43.760 --> 07:46.360
Don't be so insulting!

07:46.360 --> 07:49.660
We really are busy with a lot of things right now.

07:50.600 --> 07:52.070
Never mind.

07:52.070 --> 07:55.040
W..Wait! Where are you going?!

08:01.880 --> 08:03.440
This is bad...

08:03.440 --> 08:07.570
If Roya acts on her own again,
it will be just too much!

08:12.550 --> 08:16.510
Fine, if that's how it is,
I'll just go to Neotopia alone!

08:22.430 --> 08:25.070
The reinforcements still aren't assembled?!

08:25.070 --> 08:28.170
We are making preparations; settle down.

08:28.170 --> 08:30.140
Such complacence!

08:31.170 --> 08:34.110
My country of Neotopia is a Templar ally,

08:34.110 --> 08:36.880
and our territory is about to fall into enemy hands!

08:36.880 --> 08:39.950
Some philanthropy and harmony this is!

08:39.950 --> 08:42.980
I hate to take exception here,

08:42.980 --> 08:47.660
but you do realize your country
has barred Elder Zico entry?!

08:47.660 --> 08:48.920
She's right.

08:48.920 --> 08:52.880
I fear you might be asking a bit too much of us.

08:54.760 --> 08:56.830
Can it be that you don't understand

08:56.830 --> 09:01.130
the reason we're still confining Elder Zico to jail?

09:01.500 --> 09:03.370
Sebastian!

09:03.370 --> 09:08.310
The holder of Templar's highest office
wants to act personally here.

09:08.310 --> 09:11.440
I'd like you to think carefully about that.

09:49.920 --> 09:51.710
What's happening?

09:54.860 --> 09:57.650
Amir Gaul...

10:19.180 --> 10:21.020
What is this form?

10:21.020 --> 10:24.190
What does this mean?!

10:24.190 --> 10:28.320
Is this Amir Gaul?

11:07.460 --> 11:09.260
Did that kill him?

11:11.330 --> 11:13.130
We defeated him!

11:21.910 --> 11:23.540
Noah!

11:24.980 --> 11:27.780
Hugh, you bastard!

11:37.060 --> 11:39.260
You fool.

11:39.260 --> 11:43.720
Someone like you could never withstand
the power of Amir Gaul.

11:47.840 --> 11:49.800
Noah! Zed!

11:52.370 --> 11:54.580
You can't do anything for them now.

11:54.580 --> 11:56.700
Let's stay here and keep an eye on things.

12:00.080 --> 12:03.450
Everything is under my control.

12:03.450 --> 12:06.750
Everything is in my hands.

12:25.570 --> 12:29.780
Your Holiness, I've received word from Kira.

12:29.780 --> 12:32.310
The Ulvarx spirit has been defeated,

12:32.310 --> 12:35.680
but Zed and Noah have fallen into Hugh's hands.

12:35.680 --> 12:37.950
What?! Noah as well?!

12:37.950 --> 12:39.580
Yes...

12:43.590 --> 12:46.730
What do you mean to do with their key spirits?

12:46.730 --> 12:49.600
First things first: we're going to take the castle.

12:49.600 --> 12:53.030
After that, I'll destroy them with my own hands.

12:53.030 --> 12:54.400
Destroy them?!

12:54.400 --> 12:57.870
Nudyu, you guard them until we come back.

12:57.870 --> 12:59.500
Sire!

13:01.610 --> 13:04.040
It looks like you're awake.

13:04.040 --> 13:07.310
This war will be over very soon

13:07.310 --> 13:09.750
with us as the victors.

13:09.750 --> 13:15.190
Hyrum will undoubtedly divide the
Neotopian forces in an effort to rescue you.

13:15.190 --> 13:16.920
That's how we'll get him!

13:16.920 --> 13:19.860
We're approaching the end.

13:19.860 --> 13:23.330
I shall go to take the castle.

13:23.330 --> 13:25.700
What can you do?

13:25.700 --> 13:26.930
I'll go.

13:26.930 --> 13:28.560
What?!

13:29.270 --> 13:32.940
Mere puppets like you shouldn't talk big.

13:32.940 --> 13:34.740
Damn you...

13:37.610 --> 13:40.650
I'll let you in on a secret.

13:40.650 --> 13:45.920
After we've captured the castle,
you two are going to be executed.

13:45.920 --> 13:48.220
By me!

13:54.860 --> 13:56.500
I'm going to go help Noah.

13:56.500 --> 13:57.930
I'll go too!

13:57.930 --> 13:59.030
You'll get in my way.

13:59.030 --> 14:01.330
Stay here and sit tight.

14:17.120 --> 14:19.590
Are you sure this was the right decision,
Your Holiness?

14:20.190 --> 14:26.330
Dividing our forces, even for Noah's sake,
will weaken our defenses.

14:26.330 --> 14:28.230
It doesn't matter!

14:28.230 --> 14:33.070
To rescue Noah is to save this country!

14:33.070 --> 14:36.700
Do not forget that Noah is the savior!

14:38.140 --> 14:40.010
Yes, Your Holiness.

14:40.010 --> 14:46.310
Holy Father Hyrum may misunderstand
the meaning of " the savior" .

14:55.660 --> 14:58.120
We'll take the castle by storm!

15:09.470 --> 15:12.370
Noah, are your wounds okay?

15:12.370 --> 15:14.010
I'm all right.

15:14.010 --> 15:16.140
What about you, Zed?

15:16.140 --> 15:17.240
I'm fine!

15:17.240 --> 15:19.710
No way am I going to kick the bucket
in a place like this!

15:20.750 --> 15:23.480
I wonder how the castle is doing?

15:23.480 --> 15:24.990
And Holy Father Hyrum?

15:24.990 --> 15:27.780
Damn that Hugh!

15:32.560 --> 15:36.400
Noah, doesn't it seem strange to you sometimes?

15:36.400 --> 15:39.530
I mean, why are we in this world?

15:39.530 --> 15:42.470
Why are we warring?

15:42.470 --> 15:46.770
Yeah, but I'm glad it all happened.

15:47.510 --> 15:51.750
If nothing else, I was able to grow
strong by coming here.

15:51.750 --> 15:54.750
What does " growing strong" mean to you?

15:54.750 --> 15:57.380
Is it really so important?

15:58.120 --> 16:02.990
Yes, having a strong heart is important.

16:02.990 --> 16:06.130
It's key to being a strong person.

16:06.130 --> 16:08.730
And you're saying that's thanks to Absolute Law?

16:08.730 --> 16:09.900
Yes!

16:09.900 --> 16:12.970
Noah, I keep telling you that's wrong!

16:12.970 --> 16:15.600
No, it is not wrong.

16:16.870 --> 16:20.330
It is absolutely not wrong.

16:28.480 --> 16:30.280
It's time for the changing of the guard.

16:30.280 --> 16:31.910
Right.

16:32.550 --> 16:35.320
Wait! It's too early for that!

16:35.320 --> 16:37.120
Who are you?!

16:45.470 --> 16:47.260
Why, you!

16:59.980 --> 17:01.950
You're the girl from Templar!

17:02.750 --> 17:04.720
Roya!

17:05.450 --> 17:07.580
I'm so glad you're okay!

17:17.430 --> 17:20.890
Men, we hold the first defensive wall
no matter what!

17:26.810 --> 17:28.540
Yes!

17:28.540 --> 17:30.340
What's that?

17:45.760 --> 17:47.760
All right, that's one!

17:47.760 --> 17:50.730
The first defensive wall is breached!

17:56.600 --> 17:59.900
We must rescue Master Noah at all costs!

18:09.320 --> 18:10.380
Noah!

18:10.380 --> 18:11.490
Noah!

18:11.490 --> 18:12.450
Kira!

18:12.450 --> 18:15.260
Roya! What are you doing here?!

18:15.260 --> 18:16.560
We'll talk later!

18:16.560 --> 18:18.330
Sagiri told me everything.

18:18.330 --> 18:20.450
Hang on, I'll free you right now.

18:23.360 --> 18:25.070
Your arm...

18:25.070 --> 18:26.900
Zed, what happened to your arm?

18:26.900 --> 18:31.530
I have no clue what the deal is.

18:36.540 --> 18:38.340
Let's hide for now.

18:48.360 --> 18:52.560
Hugh, you scum, I won't let you have your way!

18:52.560 --> 18:55.700
I'll be the one to take the key spirits,

18:55.700 --> 18:58.670
in order to resurrect Great Tusker.

19:19.450 --> 19:21.420
Come on, now's our chance!

19:22.690 --> 19:24.820
Wh..What's the commotion here?!

19:26.630 --> 19:32.370
Oh, you little brats, getting so full of yourselves...

19:32.370 --> 19:36.270
I, Nudyu, will execute all of you!

19:36.270 --> 19:37.900
Marakia!

19:42.940 --> 19:44.910
Leave this to me.

19:58.930 --> 20:00.090
This is bad...

20:00.090 --> 20:02.560
At this rate, we'll lose the
second defensive wall too.

20:11.070 --> 20:14.240
Th..The second defensive wall!

20:14.240 --> 20:16.540
All right, that's two!

20:29.620 --> 20:32.790
All right, boys, that's three!

20:32.790 --> 20:34.920
It's all over now!

20:57.220 --> 20:58.840
Your Holiness...

21:00.320 --> 21:04.450
We still haven't been able to rescue Noah?

21:14.530 --> 21:17.160
What should we do? At this rate...

21:18.370 --> 21:19.410
Master Nudyu!

21:19.410 --> 21:21.480
Master Nudyu, your orders!

21:21.480 --> 21:22.480
Master Nudyu!

21:22.480 --> 21:24.100
Master Nudyu!

21:28.650 --> 21:30.280
Master Nudyu!

21:40.830 --> 21:43.830
Noah, we have to hurry to
Holy Father Hyrum's chamber.

21:43.830 --> 21:45.800
Yeah, I know.

21:46.300 --> 21:48.100
What's that?!

21:48.540 --> 21:50.970
The arches are smashed down!

21:50.970 --> 21:52.770
Could they have...

22:08.920 --> 22:12.880
I've come all the way here at last, Hyrum.

22:13.530 --> 22:16.730
Move it, that's my place.

22:16.730 --> 22:18.360
Hugh...

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Even if we've been far apart

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Our hearts are still connected

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
And always will be, even to the end of time

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:09.680
My old days

23:09.680 --> 23:12.050
Living it up on the weekend as always

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Just simply having fun, innocently

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days, gone in the blink of an eye

23:19.760 --> 23:22.130
Since then, we've gone our separate ways

23:22.130 --> 23:24.030
Chasing our own goals

23:24.030 --> 23:25.030
We grow up

23:25.030 --> 23:26.700
Tuck our memories in our hearts, and wave

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Fix our eyes on where we're going

23:27.870 --> 23:29.870
Neither of us will give up

23:29.870 --> 23:31.510
Knowing the other's fighting just as hard

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
I don't mind if you're not near me

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
I want to see your smile, but it's not the time

23:35.580 --> 23:36.580
The more I look back

23:36.580 --> 23:37.580
The more I tell myself I'll show this to you one day

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
That will never change

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Even if we've been far apart

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Our hearts are still connected

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
And always will be, even to the end of time

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

24:17.250 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
Endless Battle

24:18.390 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "Endless Battle"
